  "label": "U.S. soldiers observing bodies in a crematorium are mapped as witnesses to the horrors of the Holocaust",
  "description": "The top text overlay 'the horrors of the holocaust three u.s. soldiers look at bodies' explicitly identifies the U.S. soldiers in the image as observers of the Holocaust's atrocities. The visual material of the soldiers looking into the crematorium oven is directly mapped onto this textual description, establishing that the soldiers are the subjects of the horror narrative described in the text.",
